    <briefdescription>
<para>Shows the runs of a <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1TransitionRunner" kindref="compound">TransitionRunner</ref></computeroutput> as the drawn data points of a <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1DataPointStore" kindref="compound">DataPointStore</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The store&apos;s data points have no attributes. The drawn data points change on <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1Internal_1_1StoreTransition_1ab3ee2edeba5a35cce9aa75aed77bb3f2" kindref="member">advance()</ref></computeroutput>, <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1Internal_1_1StoreTransition_1ad738005ca76b95ee0723f7fa0c197e32" kindref="member">end()</ref></computeroutput>, and <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1Internal_1_1StoreTransition_1a56b628dde1a343787bbc58449062d160" kindref="member">discard()</ref></computeroutput>, so the series refreshes what depends on them, such as its hover lookup, after each. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
